    <article class="mt-6">
      <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-uwais-muted">
        The Indonesian film industry is currently experiencing a golden era, especially in the action genre that blends emotional family drama elements. 
        One of the most attention-grabbing projects lately is a cinematic work that promises nonstop tension. 
        For action film enthusiasts, knowing the <b>cast list of Ikatan Darah film</b> is not just about identifying the stars, 
        but about understanding how each character brings life to a complex narrative.</p>

      <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-uwais-muted">
        This film is not only about brutal physical combat but also about inner conflict and tested loyalty. 
        Through precise direction, <a href="/en/movie/ikatan-darah/" class="text-uwais-red underline underline-offset-4">Ikatan Darah Film</a> successfully combines visual aesthetics with authentic martial arts choreography, 
        setting a new benchmark in the national cinema landscape.
      </p>

      <section class="mt-10">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-medium text-white mb-4">
           Why Is This Film Trending?
        </h2>
        <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-uwais-muted">
        Before diving deeper into the <b><i>cast list of Ikatan Darah film</i></b>, it’s important to understand what sets this film apart from typical action movies. 
        Amid the surge of horror films, the presence of a solid action drama brings a refreshing experience for audiences.
        </p>

        <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-uwais-muted">
          In Ikatan Darah, viewers are taken into a world where every decision carries fatal consequences. 
          Blood relations, which should serve as a bond, instead become the main source of conflict, creating layers of deep emotion in every scene. 
          This is why interest in its cast is so high; audiences want to know which actors can execute such demanding roles with a balance of character acting and physical capability.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="mt-10">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-medium text-white mb-3">
          Cast of Ikatan Darah Film and Their Characters
        </h2>

        <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-uwais-muted">
          Here are the actors involved in this film project:
        </p>

        <ol class="list-decimal pl-5 mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-uwais-muted">
          <li class="mt-4 font-semibold text-white text-lg">
            Livi Ciananta
          </li>

          <p>
          Livi Ciananta emerges as a figure who brings a fresh presence to Indonesia’s action actress lineup. Her role in Ikatan Darah demands a drastic emotional transition—from vulnerability to a resilient fighter. 
          Her performance proves that she is one of the most promising talents today.
          </p>

          <li class="mt-4 font-semibold text-white text-lg">
            Derby Romero
          </li>

          <p>
          We have known Derby for a long time, but in this project, he showcases a side never seen before. 
          As part of the Ikatan Darah cast, Derby demonstrates remarkable acting maturity. 
          His gaze and body language reflect the weight of the character he carries, especially in confrontational scenes.
          </p>

          <li class="mt-4 font-semibold text-white text-lg">
            Ismi Melinda
          </li>

          <p>
          It would be incomplete to discuss Ikatan Darah without mentioning Ismi Melinda. 
          Known for her strong martial arts background, Ismi delivers high intensity in every fight choreography. 
          She is not merely a supporting presence but a real threat on screen that keeps audiences on edge.
          </p>

          <li class="mt-4 font-semibold text-white text-lg">
            Teuku Rifnu Wikana
          </li>

          <p>
          Teuku Rifnu’s presence always guarantees quality in a film. In this lineup, 
          he acts as a narrative anchor that ensures the drama remains grounded and human amid the chaos of explosions and combat.
          </p>

          <li class="mt-4 font-semibold text-white text-lg">
            Lydia Kandou
          </li>

          <p>
          Completing the Ikatan Darah cast, veteran actress Lydia Kandou brings her own authority. 
          Her role often becomes the key to the mystery surrounding the main plot, proving that her acting prowess remains timeless.
          </p>

          <li class="mt-4 font-semibold text-white text-lg">
            Strong Supporting Cast
          </li>

          <p>
          Beyond the big names above, the film’s strength also lies in its supporting actors such as Abdurrahman Arif, Rama Ramdhan, Agra Piliang, and Dimas Anggara. 
          Dimas Anggara, in particular, delivers a surprising performance that contrasts with his usual romantic image. 
          Together, they create a cohesive world that feels both alive and dangerous.</p>
        </ol>
      </section>

