        </p>

        <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-uwais-muted">
          The actors spent months undergoing intensive physical training to ensure they could perform their own stunts. 
          This adds value to Ikatan Darah, as audiences can truly feel the authenticity of the pain and effort poured into each clash scene. 
          The dynamic cinematography, 
          with camera movements that follow the actors, makes viewers feel as if they are in the middle of the battle.
        </p>
